OL,3,GNEWSA'I had a normal smear test - three
OL,4,Ayears later I had cervical cancer'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I had a perfectly normal smear and in
OL,7,Fthree-and-a-half years, I had gone from
OL,8,Fbeing healthy to having cervical
OL,9,Fcancer."
OL,11,FSophie Bagnall, 38, from Ironbridge in
OL,12,FShropshire, was diagnosed with cervical
OL,13,Fcancer when she was 29 after a routine
OL,14,Fsmear test.
OL,16,FNow eight years cancer-free, she said
OL,17,F"nothing compares" to a cancer
OL,18,Fdiagnosis, and urged women to have
OL,19,Ftheir test as soon as they are
OL,20,Feligible.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
