OL,3,GNEWSA'I had a normal smear test - three
OL,4,Ayears later I had cervical cancer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as a new cervical screening
OL,7,Fmobile health hub is heading to
OL,8,FWolverhampton, in hopes of encouraging
OL,9,Fmore eligible women to have their smear
OL,10,Ftests.
